(text "S1P is one continuous insulated primary conductor through the sensor aperture; no electrical sensor terminal exists there. K1 and K2 are normally open. Their\ncoil/auxiliary symbols are on sheet 02. RPRE is bolted to the PE thermal plate. Output remains hazardous. Contactors do not provide service isolation; lock out both DC\nand auxiliary sources. No MOV: controlled source terminal transients <=500 V is an operating restriction; fault-energy coordination remains open." (at 20.32 22.86 0)
          (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
          (uuid "40c6dec9-5cec-500b-8774-2b05f5f0a43f"))
